				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-625548/only-game-in-town-hub#post-1713267</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 17 Feb 2013 23:42:59 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>1324229</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Ayep. We only got ~50% of the stuff we wanted to write done.</p> <p>Also, people should totally add stuff to the canon! My only requests are that when you put in the hub, 1) Put it something approaching-ish chronological order (so no futuristic sci-fi scenarios right after &quot;Pieces of Mind&quot;) and 2) that you add a quote before your thing. It can be thematically or directly relevant to the story, or it can be only tangentially related.</p> <p>e: Thanks to Jack Manganese for letting me steal a line from his great piece <a href="http://wanderers-library.wikidot.com/every-story-someday">Every Story Someday</a>, and to Rumetzen for writing the quote for The End.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
